      "fallbackReason": null,
      "text": "#RetardedTherapy \n\nNot all relationships end well, we.. most of us have exes, sometimes they are the divorced men and women of our lives, sometimes they are just the relationships that never blossomed to the full, and some of these men and women will be very toxic to your life.\n\nThey might think you ruined their lives, that you were simply nothing but a lie, they might think that you were a very malicious person who purposefully spread bad things about them.\n\nThis might be true, or it might not be, it does not actually matter in the grand scheme of things,\n\nPeople would always think they are right, its just the nature of most of them.\n\nI can not tell you what to do about them, but I can tell you this - be happy you found out about this part of them before it went on further.",
